'''Cheerleader Cat '''is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 5.6 Update|Version 5.6]] and can be unlocked when beating [[Unholy Tempest (Insane)|Unholy Tempest]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 8.4 Update|Version 8.4]] increases health and attack power. This unit is obtainable on the [[The Battle Cats Unite!|Nintendo Switch version]] when beating [[N77 Nebula (Cats of the Cosmos)|N77 Nebula]].

